{"3393280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anime Shop Simulator ✨", "steam_appid": 3393280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/f038059f6b906eac0e7f5a0cea32dc62.avif?t=1787979437\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime Shop Simulator</strong> is fun first-person simulation where you become the manager of your very own anime shop!  <br><br>Play solo or join forces with friends in online co-op to expand your shop, attract more customers, and create the ultimate otaku and trading card paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/524eec49e7d2ce035bad39ff01db833d.poster.avif?t=1787979437\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/524eec49e7d2ce035bad39ff01db833d.webm?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/524eec49e7d2ce035bad39ff01db833d.mp4?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR SHOP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your dream Anime Shop! Arrange manga, figures, and collectible cards on the shelves to create a seamless and enjoyable shopping experience for your customers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CO-OP GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with your friends online in 4-player co-op mode to manage your anime shop together, divide responsibilities, and plan strategies to maximize your profits.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ORDER PRODUCTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your anime shop with a variety of manga, collectible card packs, and anime merchandise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/725e2afeaa3a936bf1cc9d1686ead861.poster.avif?t=1787979437\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/725e2afeaa3a936bf1cc9d1686ead861.webm?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/725e2afeaa3a936bf1cc9d1686ead861.mp4?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT THEM ALL AND FIGHT IN PVP!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbox booster packs and discover unique treasures! Find rare collectible cards to sell for a profit or keep them to complete your ultimate anime card collection. Fight with other players in PvP TCG game and find out who's the best! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/adfdb87790101c6623c9cbf83cd4d6d3.poster.avif?t=1787979437\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/adfdb87790101c6623c9cbf83cd4d6d3.webm?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/adfdb87790101c6623c9cbf83cd4d6d3.mp4?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your anime store into a one-of-a-kind otaku haven! Choose your favorite wallpaper, give your shop a unique name, and decorate it with items to reflect your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/ed0bfc96a24645606887d44881685410.poster.avif?t=1787979437\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/ed0bfc96a24645606887d44881685410.webm?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/ed0bfc96a24645606887d44881685410.mp4?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVENTS AND FESTIVALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host autograph signings and trading card tournaments for anime fans to draw in more customers and boost your store’s popularity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enlarge your shop, upgrade its decor, and stay in tune with the dynamic trends of the anime industry to remain competitive.<br><br>In <strong>Anime Shop Simulator</strong> your decisions shape your journey. Can you transform your small boutique into a thriving otaku hub while balancing customer satisfaction and financial success?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/f038059f6b906eac0e7f5a0cea32dc62.avif?t=1787979437\" width=620 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime Shop Simulator</strong> is fun first-person simulation where you become the manager of your very own anime shop!  <br><br>Play solo or join forces with friends in online co-op to expand your shop, attract more customers, and create the ultimate otaku and trading card paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vid