/strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbox booster packs and discover unique treasures! Find rare collectible cards to sell for a profit or keep them to complete your ultimate anime card collection. Fight with other players in PvP TCG game and find out who's the best! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/adfdb87790101c6623c9cbf83cd4d6d3.poster.avif?t=1787979437\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/adfdb87790101c6623c9cbf83cd4d6d3.webm?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/adfdb87790101c6623c9cbf83cd4d6d3.mp4?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your anime store into a one-of-a-kind otaku haven! Choose your favorite wallpaper, give your shop a unique name, and decorate it with items to reflect your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/ed0bfc96a24645606887d44881685410.poster.avif?t=1787979437\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/ed0bfc96a24645606887d44881685410.webm?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3393280/extras/ed0bfc96a24645606887d44881685410.mp4?t=1787979437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVENTS AND FESTIVALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host autograph signings and trading card tournaments for anime f